WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.766
Step 1. Open the Medicine Administration sub-tab.

1.2
00:00:03.766 --> 00:00:06.995
Stopping a medicine sets its status to Ended,

1.3
00:00:06.995 --> 00:00:13.523
and Care no longer offers its doses for administration. Each row shows one medicine.

2.1
00:00:13.523 --> 00:00:15.996
Step 2. Select what to stop.

2.2
00:00:15.996 --> 00:00:21.792
Select Discontinue on the row of the medicine to stop every active entry.

2.3
00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:26.262
To stop one entry, expand the row and select Stop.

3.1
00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:31.671
Step 3. Confirm. In Discontinue Medication Group, select Discontinue.

3.2
00:00:31.671 --> 00:00:33.315
Care shows no message.

3.3
00:00:33.315 --> 00:00:39.721
The row is hidden, and Show discontinued brings it back with the Stopped badge.
